<section class="contact-page"><div class="content-page__intro"><span class="eyebrow">Xilveno / customer care</span><h1>Contact us</h1><p>Questions about an order, a product, or delivery? Send us a note and our team will help.</p></div><div class="contact-layout"><div class="contact-details"><h2>We’re here to help.</h2><p>For order support, include your order number so we can get back to you quickly.</p><div><span class="eyebrow">Email</span><a href="mailto:support@xilveno.com">support@xilveno.com</a></div><div><span class="eyebrow">Response time</span><p>Usually within one business day.</p></div></div>{% form 'contact', class: 'contact-form' %}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<div class="form-success">Thanks — your message has been received.</div>{% endif %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}<label>Name<input type="text" name="contact[name]" required></label><label>Email<input type="email" name="contact[email]" required></label><label>Order number <span>(optional)</span><input type="text" name="contact[order_number]"></label><label>Message<textarea name="contact[body]" rows="6" required></textarea></label><button class="button button--accent" type="submit">Send message <span>→</span></button>{% endform %}</div></section>
